  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> be the ratio of the roots of the quadratic equation in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the least value of <math><mi>m</mi></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "U6a6F",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Gvidl",
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cfVR5",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1m3fI",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
