  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p>Using equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, the least value of <math><mi>m</mi></math> is <math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>.</p>",
